{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.44:1.3"], "en": "“Mother, seeing me alive,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.44:1.4"], "en": "why do you weep for me, mother?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.44:1.5"], "en": "… [Thus spoke] the Elder Sānu.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
